      "text": "T=0:00   Hub publishes control.schedule to all agents\n\nT=0:02   Agent us-ord wakes (stagger=2s), starts probing 45 targets\nT=0:14   Agent fr-par wakes (stagger=14s), starts probing 45 targets\nT=0:27   Agent ap-south wakes (stagger=27s), starts probing\n\nT=~4:00  First agents finish sweep, results flowing to hub\nT=~5:00  All agents done — hub has full 2,070-result matrix\n\nT=15:00  Next sweep begins",
